<urn:atm:triage:finding/AG19-ARCH-AG15-004-REGRESSION>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AG19-ARCH-AG15-004-REGRESSION" ;
  triage:title "Shipped acceptance test for ARCH-AG15-004 asserts inverse of required behavior" ;
  triage:description "Test cross_host_send_and_ack_round_trip_and_failed_ack_stays_pending asserts a warning string 'ATM deferred remote ack delivery' that does not exist in production code. dispatch_delivery.rs build_remote_deferred_outcome always sets warnings: Vec::new(). Test also asserts pending_ack_at.is_none() and acknowledged_at.is_some(), requiring acknowledged local state for a message with deferred remote ack delivery, which is the inverse of the test name and sprint acceptance criterion: deferred/unknown remote ack outcomes must NOT mark source message acknowledged locally." ;
  triage:category "AG" ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AG" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:severity "Blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-daemon/src/tests/runtime_root/cross_host.rs and crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health/dispatch_delivery.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-19T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AG19-ARCH-AG15-004-REGRESSION/AG19/1> ;
  triage:fixedOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s19/dc05145b> ;
  triage:notes "AG19-FIX-1-QA-RECHECK-1 verdict (2026-07-19, /Users/randlee/.config/atm/share/atm-dev/ag19-fix1-qa-recheck1-verdict.md) and independent team-lead direct read of cross_host.rs at dc05145b confirm this is fixed: the test now asserts the CORRECT direction -- Deferred outcome, empty warnings, pending_ack_at.is_some(), acknowledged_at.is_none() (lines 236-263). Confirmed independently by req-qa, arch-qa, rust-service-hardening-agent, and team-lead's own read. Closed." .

